   "html": "<section class=\"shopify-section sc-tiers-section\" id=\"shopify-section-template--23043659989235__shotclub_tiers_VWyi4k\"><style data-shopify=\"\">\n  .sc-tiers {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 64px 20px 64px;\n    color: #0e0e14;\n    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__inner {\n    max-width: 880px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__head {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__rule {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n    color: #60606e;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__rule-line {\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: #b6b6c2;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__title {\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    letter-spacing: -0.012em;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__title em {\n    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Georgia', serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #60606e;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__sub {\n    margin: 12px auto 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: #60606e;\n    max-width: 480px;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin-top: 36px;\n  }\n  .sc-tier {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid #d9d9e0;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 22px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .sc-tier--highlight {\n    border-color: #0e0e14;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(12,12,20,0.04), 0 8px 24px rgba(12,12,20,0.06);\n  }\n  .sc-tier__head {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__name {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -0.012em;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__badge {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n    background: #0e0e14;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__badge::before {\n    content: '';\n    height: 6px;\n    width: 6px;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    background: #fcd34d;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__price {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__price-num {\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: -0.012em;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__price-cycle {\n    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Georgia', serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #60606e;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__blurb {\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    color: #60606e;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__features {\n    margin: 18px 0 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    list-style: none;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__feature {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 10px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #2e2e38;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__feature::before {\n    content: '';\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    height: 6px;\n    width: 6px;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    background: #0e0e14;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__cta {\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: #2e2e38;\n    border: 1px solid #d9d9e0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    transition: background 200ms ease;\n  }\n  .sc-tier--highlight .sc-tier__cta {\n    background: #0e0e14;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border-color: #0e0e14;\n  }\n  .sc-tier__cta:hover {\n    background: #f7f7f8;\n  }\n  .sc-tier--highlight .sc-tier__cta:hover {\n    background: #1c1c24;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__footnote {\n    margin-top: 28px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #60606e;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .sc-tiers__footnote a {\n    color: #0e0e14;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  @media (min-width: 640px) {\n    .sc-tiers__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; }\n    .sc-tiers__title { font-size: 36px; }\n    .sc-tiers__sub { font-size: 16px; }\n    .sc-tier { padding: 24px; }\n    .sc-tier__price-num { font-size: 36px; }\n  }\n</style>\n<section class=\"sc-tiers\">\n<div class=\"sc-tiers__inner\">\n<div class=\"sc-tiers__head\">\n<div class=\"sc-tiers__rule\">\n<span class=\"sc-tiers__rule-line\"></span>\n<span>Membership tiers</span>\n<span class=\"sc-tiers__rule-line\"></span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sc-tiers__title\">\n        Two memberships.\n        <em>One door.</em>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"sc-tiers__sub\">\n        Both unlock the full library and a commercial license. Switch (or cancel) any time from your account.\n      </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sc-tiers__grid\"><div class=\"sc-tier\">\n<div class=\"sc-tier__head\">\n<h3 class=\"sc-tier__name\">Creator</h3></div>\n<div class=\"sc-tier__price\">\n<span class=\"sc-tier__price-num\">$20</span>\n<span class=\"sc-tier__price-cycle\">/ month</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sc-tier__blurb\">50 downloads / month. Same library, lighter appetite.</p>\n<ul class=\"sc-tier__features\"><li class=\"sc-tier__feature\">50 HD downloads / month</li><li class=\"sc-tier__feature\">All aspect ratios</li><li class=\"sc-tier__feature\">New drops monthly</li><li class=\"sc-tier__feature\">Commercial license included</li></ul>\n<a class=\"sc-tier__cta\" href=\"https://www.shotclubai.com/pricing?utm_source=moonbear.shop&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;ref=moonbear&amp;utm_source=moonbear\">\n              Apply for Basic →\n            </a>\n</div><div class=\"sc-tier sc-tier--highlight\">\n<div class=\"sc-tier__head\">\n<h3 class=\"sc-tier__name\">Pro</h3><span class=\"sc-tier__badge\">Members' favorite</span></div>\n<div class=\"sc-tier__price\">\n<span class=\"sc-tier__price-num\">$30</span>\n<span class=\"sc-tier__price-cycle\">/ month</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sc-tier__blurb\">Unlimited downloads. The full club.</p>\n<ul class=\"sc-tier__features\"><li class=\"sc-tier__feature\">Unlimited HD downloads</li><li class=\"sc-tier__feature\">All aspect ratios</li><li class=\"sc-tier__feature\">New drops monthly</li><li class=\"sc-tier__feature\">Commercial license included</li><li class=\"sc-tier__feature\">Priority access to new drops</li></ul>\n<a class=\"sc-tier__cta\" href=\"https://www.shotclubai.com/pricing?utm_source=moonbear.shop&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;ref=moonbear&amp;utm_source=moonbear\">\n              Apply for Pro →\n            </a>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"sc-tiers__footnote\">\n<a href=\"https://shotclubai.com/pricing\">Compare plans in detail</a>\n      · Prices in USD · Taxes added where required.\n    </p>\n</div>\n</section>\n</section>"
